---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="FAQ - LearnLoom" description="Find answers to frequently asked questions about online tutoring at LearnLoom, including enrollment, teaching methods, assessments, grade criteria, and our free Olympiad question bank.">
    <!-- FAQPage Schema for Google Rich Snippets -->
    <script type="application/ld+json" is:inline set:html={JSON.stringify({
        "@context": "https://schema.org",
        "@type": "FAQPage",
        "mainEntity": [
            {
                "@type": "Question",
                "name": "How to Enroll?",
                "acceptedAnswer": {
                    "@type": "Answer",
                    "text": "Once you click the 'Register or Enroll' button on our website, you fill out a short form to help us understand your child's need. Post this, an academic counsellor is assigned, and a trial class may be provided. Once satisfied, the enrolment process begins."
                }
            },
            {
                "@type": "Question",
                "name": "What are the benefits of these math classes?",
                "acceptedAnswer": {
                    "@type": "Answer",
                    "text": "Learn Loom travels with the child parallel to their school curriculum. Along with it, we prepare them to ace in their competitive exam. The experts plan the curriculum well to utilise the stipulated time in a friendly way, and keeping the interest alive."
                }
            },
            {
                "@type": "Question",
                "name": "How are these classes different from the school?",
                "acceptedAnswer": {
                    "@type": "Answer",
                    "text": "The lesson plan will include projects beyond books within the module, to ensure active learning. The teachers will be using interactive math tools to keep the interest alive and make sessions more fun."
                }
            },
            {
                "@type": "Question",
                "name": "How are assessment and progress of the child done?",
                "acceptedAnswer": {
                    "@type": "Answer",
                    "text": "Assignments will be given after each class to help in the formative assessment. They are uploaded and evaluated by the teacher. Moreover the parent will be constantly updated about the learning journey of the child."
                }
            },
            {
                "@type": "Question",
                "name": "What is the age criteria of the child?",
                "acceptedAnswer": {
                    "@type": "Answer",
                    "text": "Currently, we are providing lessons for grade 1-10."
                }
            },
            {
                "@type": "Question",
                "name": "How to take these classes?",
                "acceptedAnswer": {
                    "@type": "Answer",
                    "text": "Desktop, mic and internet connectivity."
                }
            },
            {
                "@type": "Question",
                "name": "Are the Olympiad question papers in Free Resources completely free to download?",
                "acceptedAnswer": {
                    "@type": "Answer",
                    "text": "Yes, every past paper, sample paper, and championship exam in our Free Resources Question Bank is 100% free to view, preview, and download as printable PDFs without requiring an account."
                }
            },
            {
                "@type": "Question",
                "name": "Which grades and subjects are covered in the Olympiad Question Bank?",
                "acceptedAnswer": {
                    "@type": "Answer",
                    "text": "Our Question Bank covers Primary School (Grades 4-5), Middle School (Grade 8), Secondary School (Grades 9-10 in General Science, Mathematics, and Social Studies), and Senior Secondary (Grades 11-12 in Advanced STEM)."
                }
            },
            {
                "@type": "Question",
                "name": "Can these question papers be used for competitive Olympiads like SOF, SilverZone, or Crest?",
                "acceptedAnswer": {
                    "@type": "Answer",
                    "text": "Yes. The questions are structured around high-order thinking skills (HOTS), pattern deduction, and conceptual reasoning typical in major national and international Olympiad competitions worldwide."
                }
            },
            {
                "@type": "Question",
                "name": "What is the best way to practice using these question papers?",
                "acceptedAnswer": {
                    "@type": "Answer",
                    "text": "We recommend setting a 60 to 90-minute timer in an exam-like environment. Afterward, analyze errors and review fundamental concepts. You can also book a personalized session with a LearnLoom mentor to accelerate scores."
                }
            }
        ]
    })} />

    <!-- Main Content Area -->
    <main class="container mx-auto px-4 py-12 flex-grow">

        <!-- FAQ Section -->
        <div class="py-12 max-w-3xl mx-auto relative">
            <!-- Background Radial Glow -->
            <div class="absolute -top-12 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-96 h-96 bg-pink-100/30 rounded-full filter blur-3xl -z-10"></div>

            <div class="text-center mb-16">
                <div class="inline-flex items-center space-x-2 bg-pink-50 border border-pink-100/60 px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full text-xs font-bold text-[#EA0264] mb-4">
                    <span>Help Center</span>
                </div>
                <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-5xl font-extrabold text-center text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">Frequently Asked Questions</h1>
                <p class="text-base md:text-lg text-slate-600 mt-3 max-w-xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">Have a question about our tutoring platform? Here are answers to the most common queries.</p>
            </div>

            <div class="space-y-4">
                <!-- FAQ Item 1 -->
                <div class="bg-white/70 backdrop-blur-md rounded-3xl shadow-md border border-slate-100 hover:border-pink-200/50 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-pink-500/5 transition-all duration-300 overflow-hidden">
                    <button
